#
# Every minute: the connections already open to an address one of this plugin's lists has just
# gained are cut (cut.py, when "Cut open connections" is on), and the TLS connections whose client
# shows a listed JA4 fingerprint are cut, the log read every two seconds through the minute
# (ja4_cut.py). With nothing to watch cut.py reads config.xml once and exits; ja4_cut.py exits so
# when Block Lists is off or the Intrusion Detection does not log JA4, and otherwise looks at
# config.xml's time every two seconds through the minute even with nothing listed, so a fingerprint
# listed during the minute is watched within two seconds (2026-10-29).
#
# Every five minutes: ThreatFox's command-and-control list (threatfox.py, 2026-11-17), where it is
# chosen, its alias made and an abuse.ch Auth-Key saved - put back into pf's table where the table lost
# it (a reboot), and fetched again only at abuse.ch's pace: its whole export once a day, its recent
# additions as often as "Fetch the lists" says. Elsewhere it reads config.xml and exits.
#
# Every minute, through the minute: what the Intrusion Detection's IPS policy drops (ids_list.py, ff-10,
# 2026-11-19), where "Block what the IPS drops" is on - its log read every three seconds, a source it
# dropped put into blocklists_ids for a while, and taken out when that is over. Off, or the IDS in IDS
# mode, it reads config.xml, takes out what is held, and exits; never turned on, it makes nothing.
#
# Every five minutes: UT1's web categories (categories.py, 2026-11-19), where one is chosen - each checked
# with UT1 as often as "Fetch the lists" says, with If-Modified-Since, so an unchanged one costs a 304 and
# nothing else; a changed one unpacked, and Unbound's blocklist rebuilt once. With none chosen and none
# kept it reads config.xml and exits, and contacts no one.

* * * * * root /usr/local/opnsense/scripts/blocklists/cut.py > /dev/null 2>&1
* * * * * root /usr/local/opnsense/scripts/blocklists/ja4_cut.py --for 58 > /dev/null 2>&1
*/5 * * * * root /usr/local/opnsense/scripts/blocklists/threatfox.py > /dev/null 2>&1
*/5 * * * * root /usr/local/opnsense/scripts/blocklists/categories.py > /dev/null 2>&1
* * * * * root /usr/local/opnsense/scripts/blocklists/ids_list.py --for 58 > /dev/null 2>&1
